                "cliffs",
                "flames"
              ],
              "correctAnswer": "B",
              "explanation": "A rebel is a person who fights the government to change it."
            },
            {
              "id": 4,
              "content": "He was the best soldier, so the king made him a ________.",
              "options": [
                "rebel",
                "cliff",
                "knight",
                "boom"
              ],
              "correctAnswer": "C",
              "explanation": "A knight is a soldier of high rank who serves a king."
            },
            {
              "id": 5,
              "content": "The ________ flashed above the water during the storm.",
              "options": [
                "flame",
                "lightning",
                "cliff",
                "armor"
              ],
              "correctAnswer": "B",
              "explanation": "Lightning is the bright light seen during a storm."
